# Auto-generated icon bundle
packages/design-system/3-primitives/src/generated/

# PR summary drafts — scratch documents for a pull request description,
# never part of the repo (see CLAUDE.md, "PR summary convention").
PR_*.md

# Audit reports, for the same reason PR summaries are ignored: they are a snapshot of a moment,
# written to be read once and acted on. `AUDIT_2026-08-11.md` rode in on an unrelated commit and
# then sat in the tree describing a repository that had moved on — which is worse than absent,
# because it reads as current.
AUDIT*.md
template-bundle.json

# Generated from we-seed.json by apps/we-electron/scripts/generate-seed-config.cjs, on every build
# and every electron dev run. Tracking them meant one developer's absolute executor path — home
# directory and all — was committed and then handed to everybody else, and that every build left the
# tree dirty with paths nobody chose. They regenerate from nothing, and main.js falls back sensibly
# when they are absent.
apps/we-electron/electron/seed-port-map.json
apps/we-electron/electron/seed-extra-resources.json
apps/we-electron/electron/seed-runtime.json
apps/we-electron/electron/seed-servers.js

# E2E test artifacts — screenshots, traces, reports. The directory structure
# persists (.gitkeep), but generated images and HTML reports do not.
e2e/screenshots/*.png
e2e/test-results/
e2e/playwright-report/

test-results/